From 7bd3705358c7efc69fea5d0de5176dcb6fb4d77f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Torben Haack <t128n@ipv4.8shield.net>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:51:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(github): support configurable GitHub Enterprise hosts

Adds ORBIT_GITHUB_URL for GHES and GHEC, derives the REST, GraphQL, OAuth, manifest, installation and link URLs from the configured host, and threads the host through sign-in, integrations, link previews, CSP and task links. The host binding lives in an unmanaged worbit_github_host_binding table so the main Orbit schema version stays stock.
